# Drape (docs/design/cloth.md, phase 2): a plane Part above a ball Part, Tool > Drape > Simulate: the plane falls
# live, wraps the ball and rests, kept as one undo step (Ctrl+Z puts the plane back); the panel's options and help.
run ui_look look=classic layout=classic        # written for the Classic look and the classic palette bar and shelves
run new_plane resolution=80
run transform translate=0,0.62,0
run part_append type=sphere size=0.5 name=Ball   # 1 m across, appended beside the plane at x = 1.6, y = 0.62
run transform translate=-1.6,-0.62,0                 # under the plane's middle (12 cm below it)
run part_select name=Plane
camera 20 -25
zoom 1.6
click "Tool##palette.tool"
click "Drape##tool.drape"
expect "##drapefabric"
expect "##drapescale"
hold ctrl
hover "##drapescale"
expect_help 1.8 m
hold none
snapshot
click "Simulate##drape"
wait_value drape_running == 1 10
wait_value drape_running == 0 60
expect_value moved > 3000
expect_value can_undo == 1
wait_idle 30
shot cloth_drape
key ctrl+z
expect_value moved == 0
